[node name="CharacterBody" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_body")]

; Deliberately a marker rather than a label on a body: fixed size so it stays
; legible from across the field, and drawn over the terrain rather than behind
; it, so a soldier in dead ground or over a rise still shows.
;
; That is a real choice and not a free one -- it means you can see where people
; are through solid earth, which in a shooter is normally the last thing you
; want. It is here because the alternative turned out to be worse: on a 228m
; map, two people who cannot find each other conclude they are in separate
; games, and a shared world nobody can find anybody in is not worth much. If
; this ever wants to become a competitive game rather than a place to muck about
; with friends, this is the first thing to take back out.
[node name="NameTag" type="Label3D" parent="."]
